    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="Translation" TIER_ID="trx_en@SPK4010">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2974"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts30">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In many developed countries there are many problems with inequalities, that is why the programs that aim at mitigating them are being planned.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2987"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts29" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts38">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In future, I want to make my own contribution.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2991"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts40" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts50">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I wish fewer people died from hunger.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2996"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts52" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts72">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Today many children suffer from curable diseases, but their countries lack vaccines or the health programs are not developed right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3005"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts71" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts86">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That is why for the next two years I will study in the direction of Political Development.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3012"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts88" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts102">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>After that I am planning to work in such organizations.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3019"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts104" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts122">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I like helping out people; that is why, in my opinion, this career path suits me well.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3027"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts121" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts144">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Don't know, considered different options, now I am considering foreign universities.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3038"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts146" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts162">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I will be taking IELTS in 2 weeks, so I have to prepare for it now. Besides, there is a motivational letter to be written.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5343"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts164" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts176">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I have nothing in my head now: what to start with, which university I am interested in - it bothers me a lot.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5345"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts178" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts196">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I have made initial steps. I have chosen the program and the direction, and now there is only documentation left.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3061"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts198" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts210">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What about your Master's? Did you choose a direction?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5695"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts254" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts276">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I want to discuss this question with everyone, with my friends, but they won't do it because it is stressful and I am thinking "Why?"</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5698"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts280" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts286">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They say 'Let's not talk about it' and I ask why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3073"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts285" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts292">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We will need it in the future, won't we?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
