    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="Translation" TIER_ID="trx_en@SPK4011">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5352"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts204">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mhm. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5699"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts212" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts226">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mhm. Can I share my impressive plan first? </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5700"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts228" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts256">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Not to get jinxed, but the majority do not like this question or haven't decided yet.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5369"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts268" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts272">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5370"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts274" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts282">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Depression.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5372"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts293" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts304">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, same. I wish you good luck with that. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5701"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts306" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts310">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know, I have read about village programs.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5702"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts312" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts325">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mostly in those Telegram and Instagram groups, you know, the ones names like "Opportunities." </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5703"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts326" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts346">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> There I used to see many internships and volunteering opportunities from UNESCO and the UN.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5704"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts347" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts357">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean they were good, but since they were not related to my  track, major, I would just say cool.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5705"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts358" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts372">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What I liked there though were the programs related to children support. Myself those programs-</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5398"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts376" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts400">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Among all those global problems like water and hunger, I felt the most sorry for children, I am a person who wants to help them.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5407"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts402" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts432">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That is why I am happy when I see such programs. So I wish you good luck with entering the program you want.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5415"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts436" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts441">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5416"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts446" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts474">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I will remember that. I will say that I knew this girl in my fourth year and will be proud.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5424"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts475" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts483">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, let me answer first to my question?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5706"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts484" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Before answering your questionm I forgot to tell a funny thing before. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5707"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts497" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts518">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> When I was small, and when I was being born, you know that relative named a godmother?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5440"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts520" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts554">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, the one that cuts your umbilical cord, they are your godparent. The doctor, that is my Godfather, that was in the maternity hospital is a minister now.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5453"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts556" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts578">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And my mother often reminds me of my Godfather minister.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5461"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts580" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts607">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>My mother used to say to me that if I look carefully at his path to become like him. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5708"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts608" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts624">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's why I wanted to say if you will be a president, than I will be your minister.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5477"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts623" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts642">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Not sure which one though, maybe the Minister of Education.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5482"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts644" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts662">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But in general, if the God allows me, I will be a Master's student.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5490"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts668" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts686">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, not really. I just want to choose a major and apply to a university.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5496"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts688" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts702">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The most important thing is that I will enter the university, for sure.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5503"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts704" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts734">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The plan is the following: next year, probably until March, I will be busy with the documents, because in the US universities, the deadline is until winter, something like December or November.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5515"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts738" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts766">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>There is also a thing called "Early decision," I mean, in Europe, it continues until March, so I am thinking of preparing the documents until March, yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5525"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts768" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts798">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, I will be busy with the Master's, and after March when I am done with it, until June, while the results and everything will be slowly coming out, I will find a job or maybe an internship. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5537"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts797" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts840">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I will then consider which one is more profitable for me because we all know that even though I want to apply to Master's, it is very expensive.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5553"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts842" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts870">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>To get a stipend, you must be one of a kind, an outstanding student.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5563"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts872" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts890">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Also there is a "Bolashak" program, but we don't know whether we will have to work in Kazakstan after studying or not.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5569"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts892" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts900">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Wasting all my time that I spent studying.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5571"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts899" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts926">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, which one is better - that one I will choose.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5582"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts928" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts942">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Or maybe I will go to Master's after working for one year, who knows.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5586"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts941" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts952">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But of course I would at least go to Master's.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5588"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts956" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts982">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, no, they removed it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5596"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts984" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1010">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean if you have one, that is OK, but they won't make you pass it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5604"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1012" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1032">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because even during the pandemic, people discussed that GRE looks like our ENT, it isn't abour your knowledge but rather your ability to pass the test.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5612"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1038" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1042">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5613"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1048" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1052">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes yes yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5614"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1054" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1088">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That is why most people look at your CV and motivational and recommendation letters.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5625"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1092" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1104">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But yes, so far I haven't chose the program, university or the country.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5630"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1103" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1126">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I've just chosen the direction, I think it will be Data Science.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5637"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1128" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1132">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>@@</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5638"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1140" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1156">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, it is interesting and just started to grow.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5646"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1158" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1186">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Also, many companies ask their employees to know some Data Science, becuase it is like a bubble or like a person with many hands who can do this and that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5655"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1185" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1222">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And in future Data Science will divide more, but know yeah, many companies want those workers.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5670"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1224" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1250">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Now I am searching for job offers and I've noticed that all jobs starting from cosmetology and all technical jobs require one to know data science.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5679"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1252" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1278">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean you just need to choose whatever is closer to you, it can even be business or marketing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5689"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1282" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1294">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And the list is growing. So, keep studying, it is interesting to learn. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5693"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1308" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1314">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mhm.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5694"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1336" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1338">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mhm.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
